ve_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100128","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100128.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100128.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99263\r\n\r\n#99263 is a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90400\r\n\r\nPreviously the ShaderData class would set its member valid to false when about to compile and then set it to true if compilation was successful (both shader compilation and setting up pipelines). IIRC we removed that since we needed to shift around how the shader was compiled run asynchronously.\r\n\r\nThen, when setting up geometry for drawing we checked if the shader_data of a material was valid, if not, we could fall back to the default material.\r\n\r\nNow instead of checking if !shader_data->valid, we check if the `shader_data->version.is_valid()`. The `version` is allocated the first time the shader succeeds at compiling. After that, `shader_data.is_valid()` will always return true. Accordingly, a way to fix this is to free the `version` if it exists already and the compilation fails. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100128/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100128/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}